DXIL geometry, hull and domain shaders in the DXIL front end (0014), on the same mesh pipeline emulation as
DXBC: GS state and emit/cut/instance/primitive ops, HS state with the control point function on the patch
threads and the patch constant function on thread 0 (then the control points go to the payload), DS domain
location and patch constants. Signatures go through the DXBC handlers. Stream 0 only, no isolines.

